# Netlify redirect rules to fix Google indexing issues

# Redirect www to non-www (main rule for most paths)
https://www.villafiscardo.com/* https://villafiscardo.com/:splat 301!

# Force HTTPS
http://villafiscardo.com/* https://villafiscardo.com/:splat 301!
http://www.villafiscardo.com/* https://villafiscardo.com/:splat 301!

# Specific blog posts that Google is reporting issues with
# These rules ensure these paths don't get additional redirects
/blog/beach-exploration /blog/beach-exploration 200!
/blog/culinary-delights /blog/culinary-delights 200!
/blog/nature-hikes /blog/nature-hikes 200!

# Static canonical pages to help Google indexing
/beach-exploration-canonical.html /beach-exploration-canonical.html 200
/culinary-delights-canonical.html /culinary-delights-canonical.html 200
/nature-hikes-canonical.html /nature-hikes-canonical.html 200